WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Testing methods. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare coastdown, tunnel and simulation claims

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Wind tunnels, coastdown tests and simulation answer different questions and carry different uncertainties. Match method to the claim.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A coastdown result includes more than aerodynamic drag unless rolling and drivetrain effects are separated.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Method selection

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Simplified flow picture; real values need test method and conditions.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare coastdown, tunnel and simulation claims
